  "reflectionQuestion": "Have you ever asked for something to be taken from you — and it was not?",
  "reflectionText": "Jesus fell on the ground and prayed. He asked three times for the cup to be removed. The answer did not come as removal. The cup remained. The disciples slept. He was alone in the asking. When the torches came through the trees, he did not hide. He stood up and walked toward the light. What is it to receive an answer that is not the removal of the thing, but the strength to keep going?",
